It is highly stable, opensource relational database management system (RDBMS).
Advanced Data Types:
    -> Supports relational data, JSON/JSONB for NoSQL workloads, geometric data and cutom types.

Basic Queries:
    select * FROM employees;
    select * FROM products WHERE price>50;
    select * FROM products ORDER BY price DESC LIMIT 5;

    insert into users (username, email) VALUES ('alice', 'alice@example.com')
    update users SET status='active' where role='guest'

    select customer_id, count(*) from orders GROUP BY customer_id;

    HAVING avg(salary) >60000
    select * from products where price > (selct avg(price) from products);

    select c.name, sum(o.amount) from customers c LEFT JOIN orders o ON c.id=o.customer_id GROUP_BY c.name;
    
